WEBVTT

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:13.263
Social puts your posts for Facebook, Instagram, Google and LinkedIn on one calendar, with AI writing each version in your brand voice. In this video, you’ll plan a post, get it approved, and see how it did.

00:00:14.333 --> 00:00:22.483
Social shows every post on its day: scheduled, posted, waiting for approval, or failed, with what needs attention alongside.

00:00:22.933 --> 00:00:30.955
Click New post, and pick the channels. Then say what it’s about, and Write with AI drafts a version for each channel, in your brand voice.

00:00:32.133 --> 00:00:41.051
Each version stays within that platform’s limits, with a live count, and the preview shows where it will go. AI never makes up prices or offers.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:44.060
Pick when it should go out, and send it for approval.

00:00:47.167 --> 00:00:56.340
The approver sees it in the post, or under Approvals, and clicks Approve, or asks for changes. Approved posts go out on their own at the time you chose.

00:00:57.133 --> 00:01:03.747
Results shows how every post did: views, reactions, comments, and shares, for each channel and each post.

